Schedule:Compact,
  Thermal Zone 4 Thermostat Schedule,     !- Name
  Thermal Zone 4 Thermostat Schedule Type Limits, !- Schedule Type Limits Name
  Through: 12/31,                         !- Field 1
  For: AllDays,                           !- Field 2
  Until: 24:00,                           !- Field 3
  4;                                      !- Field 4

ScheduleTypeLimits,
  Thermal Zone 4 Thermostat Schedule Type Limits, !- Name
